---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Project Management Services" description="Your dedicated on-site technical and commercial proxy for newbuilds, retrofits, conversions and dry-docking." nav="services" page="service-project-management" mainClass="svc-detail">

  <section class="hero page ph-service sd-hero">
    <div class="hero-inner"><div class="wrap sd-grid">
      <div class="rise">
        <span class="tag">Service 1 of 8</span>
        <h1>Project Management Services</h1>
        <p class="sub">Your dedicated on-site technical and commercial proxy for newbuilds, retrofits, conversions and dry-docking.</p>
      </div>
    </div></div>
  </section>
  <div class="body">
    <div class="wrap sd-wrap">
      <nav class="crumbs"><a href="/services/">← All services</a><span>/</span><b>Project Management Services</b></nav>
      
      <div class="sd-top reveal">
        <figure class="sd-pic plate">
          <img src="/images/svc-project.jpg" style="object-position: 50% 50%" alt="Project Management Services">
          
        </figure>
        <section class="sd-block first">
          <h4><span>1</span>What we do</h4>
          <p>We act as the shipowner&#39;s dedicated on-site technical and commercial proxy at the shipyard, protecting your capital investments throughout the lifecycle of newbuilding, retrofits, conversions and major dry-docking turnarounds. From shipyard selection to final sign-off, we ensure that projects are delivered safely, on time and within budget. We bridge the gap between shipowners and shipyards, enforcing strict technical specifications, maintaining budget discipline and guaranteeing asset compliance with international classification standards.</p>
          
        </section>
      </div>
      
      <section class="sd-block reveal">
        <h4><span>2</span>Why partner with us</h4>
        
        
        <p>We act exclusively as the shipowner&#39;s fiduciary on the shipyard floor. Because our teams have managed major shipyards from the inside, we know precisely where hidden costs are buried, how schedules are manipulated and where quality compromises occur. We leverage this insider operational intelligence to insulate your capital investments and guarantee asset performance. Our hands-on representation minimizes vessel downtime, eliminates unexpected expenses and guarantees that your assets return to sea in peak operational condition.</p>
      </section>
      
      <nav class="sd-pn">
        <span></span>
        <a class="sd-all btn dark plate" href="/services/">All services</a>
        <a class="r" href="/services/shipyard-agent/"><span class="k">Next →</span><span class="t">Shipyards Agent &amp; Representative</span></a>
      </nav>
      <div class="sd-talk plate reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Talk to our team</span>
        <h3>Interested in Project Management Services?</h3>
        <p>Tell us about your vessel or project and we'll come back with a clear plan.</p>
        <a class="btn plate" href="/contact/">Enquire now <span class="ar">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
